  "question": {
    "text": "Given below are two statements:<br /><strong>Statement I :</strong>  D-(+)-glucose $+\\mathrm{D}-(+)$ fructose $\\xrightarrow{-\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}}$ sucrose <br><strong>Statement II :</strong> Invert sugar is formed during sucrose hydrolysis.<br />In the light of the above statements, choose the <em>correct</em> answer from the options given below -",
    "image": null
  },
