  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "On hydrolysis of sucrose gives D-(+)-glucose and D-(-)-fructose while in St. (1) D-(+)-fructose is given evince St-(1) is incorrect.<br /><strong>St. II</strong> - It is correct because sucrose on hydrolysis gives invert sugar",
